The '''Ruins of Nendis''' are what remains of the night elf seaport of '''Nendis''', located along the eastern shores of [[Moonwhisper Coast]]. The town was razed by the [[naga]] on orders from [[Illidan Stormrage]], who used the port to escape to the [[Broken Isles]]. [[Maiev Shadowsong]] and the [[Watchers]] pursued Illidan to Nendis during their hunt for the Betrayer, finding the village destroyed.<ref>[https://wowpedia.fandom.com/wiki/Rise_of_the_Naga_(WC3_NightElf) Rise of the Naga (WC3 NightElf)]</ref> To this day, the naga still infest the ruins, calling themselves the [[Tideblade]] - veterans of Illidan's army led by [[Lady Serpentia]] and [[Lord Ta'jax]], lieutenants of Illidan's forces during the assault.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|56|Serpents Without Heads}}</ref>

